-- lusa::collections -- the standard heap-backed collections.
--
-- `Vec<T>`, `HashMap<K, V>`, and `String` are built into every engine, so
-- this module declares no items of its own: `use lusa::collections::HashMap`
-- (and `Vec`, `String`) resolves to the built-in type.
--
-- * `Vec<T>`: push, pop, insert, remove, get, contains, len, capacity,
--   is_empty, reserve, clear, iter.
-- * `HashMap<K, V>` (keys `string`, `i32`, or `u32`): insert, get, get_or,
--   contains_key, remove, len, is_empty, clear, iter (insertion order).
-- * `String`: push_str, push, pop, len, is_empty, clear, as_str, contains,
--   starts_with, ends_with.
